&_nc_oc=AdpFLRCqqGAaIUxK2Nybq_9BmwrVB4Xd-9r5YJw_NlMxlBLsEgB507bYn1JHjisg7zY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afz-E7GuHd0ZbsG9iqAM6IcweSl190-Yqu5UrAu76GPBRg&oe=69C29BBD"}, {"file_name": "fwa3.png", "id": "1181628443981656", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821178_1181628447314989_4274608194453586051_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1-oviktnKLsQ7kNvwHRthG2&_nc_oc=AdoX-aPdxgotJP8NEHCNabUwVFTgqdSSf-kcwl7aFh4hnONpEHCMKj-aVDP_mAqqFtY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxKWSld3ZHKxwkti_9j2s91lgsA7qLfm8GjTmoikOL0BQ&oe=69C299E4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail.png", "id": "1272221703934454", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305194_1272221707267787_1827965176633839495_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3WNs1ed5KxgQ7kNvwHaBIP2&_nc_oc=AdoHqbDBvPllO3Mq_6DHavrag0o5xDHtdwXVDG1sjoityNinXG8-RJ68ikuNW7smXPI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzYjMFXnjxcb4_H-rDMaIis79l9AMMJtRdSz4oJH6q4cw&oe=69C29A70"}, "display_name": "Lasertag", "keywords": ["pvp", "fps", "laser", "tag"], "long_description": "# Live environment scanning with no prior setup!\nQuest 3 and 3S automatically scan your environment as you play. Virtual bullets collide with real walls and furniture.\n\n# Automatic connection\nNearby players connect automatically, so starting a match is super easy.\n\n# StrikerVR blaster support\nLasertag is compatible with the StrikerVR Mavrik haptic blaster peripheral to take your laser battle experiences to the next level! Pick one up at https://strikervr.com\n\n# Early access\nThis is more of a tech-demo than a full game at the moment, but we're actively working on making the game more engaging with fleshed-out gamemodes and more weapons.\n\n# Discord\nWe have a Discord server if you have questions, issues, ideas, etc. http://discord.gg/DgTqG5A6BD", "short_descri